        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Scorpio — 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p>Fifteen needles delivered in a single burst rather than one at a time.</p><p>Make four unarmed Strikes against any creatures within 30 feet at no increase to your multiple attack penalty. Target whoever you mean to hit before you cast; the Strikes are dealt out among them in turn, so one enemy takes all four.</p><p>Each Strike that hits applies one needle in addition to its normal effect. On any day your constellation is ascendant, Strikes that miss apply a needle too.</p><p>The activity counts as three attacks for your multiple attack penalty afterward — pf2e does not count a turn's attacks, so that last clause is yours to honour.</p><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> At 15th and 19th level, add one Strike.</p><p><em>On a day your constellation is Ascendant this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a Zenith, 8 levels higher.</em></p>"
